WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:19.715
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.715 --> 00:00:27.017
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.017 --> 00:00:30.206
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.206 --> 00:00:34.427
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.427 --> 00:00:40.435
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.435 --> 00:00:45.801
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:51.377
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.377 --> 00:00:57.503
Unenrolling hides someone from check-in without deleting them.

9
00:00:57.503 --> 00:01:03.960
Find the attendee and tap Unenroll.

10
00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:09.267
The warning says exactly what will happen.

11
00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:17.004
Confirm. Their past attendance is kept either way.

12
00:01:17.004 --> 00:01:22.796
They move to the Unenrolled group, at the foot of the list.

13
00:01:22.796 --> 00:01:27.392
The tile at the top counts them too.

14
00:01:27.392 --> 00:01:36.967
Tap Re-enroll to put them back on the roster.
